{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026L5VAClsWCt1792796766.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美元匯價上升，但全個星期計微跌。</p><p></p><p>反映美元兌六隻主要貨幣的美匯指數升百分之0.1，至101.752。但全個星期計，跌近百分之0.1，即使歐元兌美元下挫。</p><p></p><p>有分析員指出，歐元受到法國動亂影響，連帶法國國債亦面對壓力，全日跌百分之0.1，報1.1202。全個星期計，跌了百分之0.3。</p><p></p><p>至於美元兌日圓就回軟，分析認為是美國科技股急挫，加上歐洲社會動盪，推動資金流入日圓避險。日圓全個星期升約百分之1，是九月初以來升幅最大的一個星期。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T00:04:27.108817+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T23:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T05:38:09.356213+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T23:58:24.445807+00:00","content_hash":"79a50565ab230280d3fda95b24350b18cfe25c1b32ff46b3e252381eadf3e7b3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T00:04:27.108817+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}